@startuml
title D-03 Vendor PMS / HCP Degraded Resolve Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Operator / Channel" as Operator
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Vendor PMS / HCP" as Vendor
database "Session Projection" as Projection
participant "ExitPass Continuity" as Continuity
participant "Supervisor Review" as Supervisor

Operator -> Central : request session resolve
Central -> Vendor : live resolve / fee request
Vendor --> Central : unavailable / degraded
Central -> Projection : check latest projection

alt projection fresh, unambiguous, and policy allows
  Central -> Continuity : degraded resolve decision
  Continuity -> Central : approved continuity basis
  Central -> Central : use approved tariff configuration\nor approved continuity basis
  Central --> Operator : payable basis / next action
else stale, ambiguous, or insufficient
  Central -> Central : fail closed
  Central -> Supervisor : route to manual / supervisor review
end

note over Projection
Passageway records and projection
do not invent tariffs.
end note

@enduml
